    "notes": "The dated renderer places Kollam Junction on the shared 16.72 m forecourt datum, with +X along the tracks to ENE and +Z toward the SSE entrance. Three platforms sit 1.1 m above grade, the entrance ramp and bridge approaches meet the sloped shoulders, and the open shed clears its three rail lines. It replaces six mapped fragments only when the model is available, retaining all other mapped buildings and transportation. The undated and out-of-range scenes preserve the original terrain and map-derived station."
  },
